' Meridian CRM 4.2 nightly case-escalation job (synthetic legacy artifact)
' Fires workflow auto_escalate for overdue New/Assigned cases (timer semantics, day granularity).
FOR EACH c IN CASE_MASTER WHERE DEL_FLG = 'N'
  IF c.STAT_CD = 'N' AND DATEDIFF(TODAY(), c.OPEN_DT) >= 2 THEN
    CALL WORKFLOW_EVENT('case_lifecycle', c.CASE_ID, 'auto_escalate')
  END IF
  IF c.STAT_CD = 'A' AND c.ESC_FLG <> 'Y' AND DATEDIFF(TODAY(), c.OPEN_DT) >= 7 THEN
    CALL WORKFLOW_EVENT('case_lifecycle', c.CASE_ID, 'auto_escalate')
  END IF
NEXT
' CALL WORKFLOW_EVENT(workflow, entity_id, event): posts an event to the workflow engine (§3).
